    "mineLabel": {
      "fr": "Ma partie : authentification, profils, service des stages et IA",
      "en": "My part: authentication, profiles, internship service and AI"
    },
    "caption": {
      "fr": "Une application Angular, une gateway et des microservices Spring qui se découvrent par Eureka. Chaque service a sa base, y compris chabot_assistant_db pour l'assistant. En pointillés : les échanges asynchrones et la découverte. La connexion faciale passe par un service de Redouane.",
      "en": "An Angular app, a gateway and Spring microservices that find each other through Eureka. Each service has its own database, including chabot_assistant_db for the assistant. Dashed: asynchronous exchanges and discovery. Face login goes through one of Redouane's services."
    }
  },
